# Where the Django API runs. Optional: while developing, the app guesses the
# computer running `npx expo start` on port 8000, and you can also change the
# address in the app (Server, at the bottom of the sign-in screen).
# Use your computer's Wi-Fi address, not localhost (on a Mac: ipconfig getifaddr en0).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8000
